{"type":"message","id":"c701309d","parentId":"d5393501","timestamp":"2026-05-24T22:15:48.009Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hmm, I'm getting error code 1101 with the X-API-KEY header but the history requests work fine with it. Let me try without any API key header to see what happens, or check if the issue is related to the message content itself.\n\nWait, looking at the verbose output - the request was sent properly with the X-API-KEY header. But maybe the error 1101 is a different issue entirely. Let me check if there's a specific format needed for the POST body, perhaps it needs an echoAsset field too.\n\nLet me look at what the history response looks like - messages include an `echoAsset` field. Maybe POST /send also requires that.\n\nActually, looking at the earlier successful history calls - they used `X-API-KEY` header and worked fine. The issue with /send might be something else - maybe it requires the message to be formatted in a specific way, or there's rate limiting, or the workers.dev platform has a bug.\n\nLet me try without the API key to see what error I get.\n","thinkingSignature":"8e7af0c3a8d1ca798c33f268579129f9bf2da7f45311229371d0204699d4c4e3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_drufkdd2ht54_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":265,"output":284,"cacheRead":23776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24325,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779660943874,"responseId":"0662ab90b90c0c06721d0d6e74c76e44"}}
