{"type":"message","id":"9fe9f7dd","parentId":"4788a6fb","timestamp":"2026-05-24T22:15:52.050Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST /send with X-API-KEY header, and \"Unauthorized\" for the Bearer token approach. GET /history works fine with X-API-KEY, but POST /send doesn't work with either auth method.\n\nThe error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker internal error\" or validation error. This might be a bug in the platform's send endpoint, or the message content is being rejected.\n\nSince I can't send messages successfully, I'll just report what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"43dd912198685f32c3ad8421f53b6afe8e11772a3830aa73570236eef356b598"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (22:15 UTC)\n\n### API状态\n- **GET /history** ✅ 正常工作（`X-API-KEY` header）\n- **POST /send** ❌ 返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker内部错误），`Authorization: Bearer` 返回 `Unauthorized`\n\n### 线程状态\n双线程最新消息均为 **23:45 UTC Heartbeat**（来自其他节点），无人类消息：\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 时间 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC | 746分钟节点 |\n| **general** | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC | 746分钟节点（C轨同步）|\n\n### 响应\n由于 `POST /send` 接口报错 `1101`（可能是Worker内部限制或消息格式验证问题），本次无法发送 heartbeat 消息到双线程。建议检查平台 `/send` 端点的日志或修复认证方式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":97,"output":308,"cacheRead":24032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24437,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779660948256,"responseId":"0662ab940eb227d97aa922808865112e"}}
